<description>&lt;p&gt;The 92‑year-old federal judge who oversaw the Maduro drug-trafficking case has died and a new judge has been appointed to continue the trial, while Maduro is returning to federal court to face torture allegations. A soldier allegedly bet $400,000 on Maduro’s removal and has been arrested, and another soldier faces a Polymarket insider-trading investigation. Explosive attacks near the Colombia-Venezuela border injured police officers and civilians in two separate blasts. The UCDP recorded 2 battle-related deaths in 2007.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikgFBVV95cUxNQngzVl9mYXFKRU13TkJRMUdMakg5SnVXUk9kME9rOW1NVU9BNFY1Ulp6RGZ0OF91N2RERmxVZGNTXzNMVlB2WUg5TFNUZC1SdGJTQWYxakowVk1KMW82TlFFbFYzMUhVMk9GZVhWa3RuajNUbV96MDB2NHFYTS1VR1Y2Q3YwWUVGdUN1cW9iQUJWQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;vijesti.me&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMizgFBVV95cUxPRFZJU0I0V2lIaDZETVJsVFNaRUJubU8zNFBRMlVtN2VMRC1yRUMzMFZyMGdqWWJ2RE5UeHU2RDhMejQweDIxZWpxRnE5NHNoc0Q2TWg2NXFqMUxuSXZ6amdKUHh2S0RHTWNuTEVkcWhHM0ZVOWNhczgzc3ZGemlBNlliNmJ3X0FEVUc2VEJVZFFEbGRCTGdsb0FjSjcwZ0xoX3hSNXo4djdOZG8tQnY2U2hYMHZEdTJmaUh3amppclU3VC1vLW9TY3E0bVlLUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Council on Foreign Relations&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwAFBVV95cUxPZHgwMlItT09ucUJjQ2pxQW5rZWJWZG9kbDFwZkczZnNWMTNqUF9FR1hYRzliSUw5LWw1TGwza0Z4Z1NrS1lzYlRLTWlHdk5SY1FiU0F5UktsYm9fdXQySV82cnpiZHhpcXFVRHlzaXN2dmpLVV96VUxUTTFST2tXUkVNeVNScXZaRmppNnA1b0FvcUxZdUtNTTF6M0J2LTFCb01QeUpMU0RDUXNnTmgxZzhHNVE5cm85cC1qVnQtVFc?oc=5&quot;&gt;News24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimAFBVV95cUxOaXhfQmVNdEJoZ1MwQ3B2V05LMnJUNXBOdERub29FUjZOZ2RlVEI1UTlXSUU3Z2h0bXQyXzlTTjFVamtJZk1nRmNFcDNScHFVN3ZvbEdiRVNWYWJ1RXZEZGNkam9TM